{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>依據合肥市市場監督管理局發佈的《關於合肥三隻羊網絡科技有限公司整改情況的通報》，三隻羊公司整改符合要求，具備恢復經營條件。</p>\n<p>按照相關法律法規及平台規則，並經有關部門批准，同意三隻羊公司在抖音平台上註銷原賬號、註冊新賬號、發佈內容和恢復經營。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/141/w550h391/20261016/469e-56caa545a4a5e795def29226fbf92d25.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://n.sinaimg.cn/finance/transform/141/w550h391/20261016/469e-56caa545a4a5e795def29226fbf92d25.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T11:00:00.299386+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":2,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:41:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T22:18:04.499972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:57:41.321447+00:00","content_hash":"c9ab000432c9d0332a36d128a3bdad6ce52c516955714d6430540ba4a1f4d71c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}